27
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:58,740
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

28
00:02:00,780 --> 00:02:06,740
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

29
00:02:07,780 --> 00:02:12,020
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

30
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:23,260
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

31
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:30,380
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

32
00:02:31,620 --> 00:02:38,260
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

33
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:46,300
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

34
00:02:47,900 --> 00:02:54,420
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

35
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:00,980
[Blossom in Darkness]

36
