166
00:11:04,110 --> 00:11:04,940
I'll be back as soon as I can.

167
00:11:21,710 --> 00:11:22,380
Honey.

168
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:25,260
Let me out.

169
00:11:26,750 --> 00:11:28,210
I'll get rid of anyone

170
00:11:28,230 --> 00:11:29,330
who tries to keep us apart.

171
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,300
I'm not your husband.

172
00:11:36,230 --> 00:11:37,540
Back then, you lost control of your demonic power.

173
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,730
You turned into a rabbit demon and devoured living creatures.

174
00:11:40,110 --> 00:11:41,210
Cheng Kong used a magical artifact

175
00:11:41,230 --> 00:11:42,380
to exchange his human form for yours.

176
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:46,180
That allowed you to stay human.

177
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:48,420
But he became the rabbit demon instead.

178
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:58,210
- Kill it! - Hurry! Kill it!

179
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,730
- Kill it! - Kill it!

180
00:12:03,110 --> 00:12:04,210
Don't hurt him!

181
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:05,660
No!

182
00:12:05,750 --> 00:12:07,340
Please, don't hurt him! I'm begging you!

183
00:12:07,350 --> 00:12:08,090
No! No!

184
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:09,300
Please, I'm begging you!

185
00:12:09,510 --> 00:12:10,900
No! Please, no!

186
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:12,610
Get out of the way!

187
