- Kill it! - Kill it!

188
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:21,060
No! No!

189
00:12:21,930 --> 00:12:23,440
- Kill it! - Kill it!

190
00:12:23,510 --> 00:12:24,610
Cheng Kong!

191
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,180
Please, I'm begging you!

192
00:12:28,350 --> 00:12:28,850
No!

193
00:12:28,870 --> 00:12:29,610
