196
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,450
- Yes! Kill it! - Kill it!

197
00:12:35,330 --> 00:12:36,020
Kill it!

198
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:37,940
Cheng Kong! Cheng...

199
00:12:57,510 --> 00:12:58,180
No!

200
00:12:59,080 --> 00:12:59,850
No!

201
00:13:01,990 --> 00:13:03,780
I hate you all!

202
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,610
They despise rabbit demons.

203
00:13:38,470 --> 00:13:40,690
So I'll make them

204
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:43,020
turn into monsters like me every night

205
00:13:43,750 --> 00:13:45,900
and devour every living thing.

206
00:13:48,230 --> 00:13:49,970
I'll put a curse on them!

207
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:53,020
They'll never be reborn.

208
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,090
They'll never find peace.

209
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,450
You've never truly

210
00:13:59,470 --> 00:14:00,780
cared about someone, have you?

211
00:14:01,510 --> 00:14:02,900
Otherwise, you'd know

212
00:14:03,230 --> 00:14:04,780
there's no way I'll stop.

213
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:06,420
If you try to stop me,

214
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:08,690
you'll die, too!

215
00:14:13,830 --> 00:14:15,610
Cheng Kong! Cheng Kong!

216
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,070
I know everything

217
00:14:20,070 --> 00:14:20,900
about your past!

218
00:14:21,110 --> 00:14:22,370
If you want to bring Xiangyuan back

219
00:14:23,110 --> 00:14:24,140
and put an end to this chaos,

220
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,780
then stop hiding in fear!

221
00:14:26,280 --> 00:14:26,900
Otherwise...

222
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,260
I admit, I don't know

223
00:15:01,230 --> 00:15:03,180
what it means to truly care about someone.

224
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,210
But there's one thing I do know.

225
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:08,780
When you lose something precious,

226
00:15:09,590 --> 00:15:11,210
you do whatever it takes to get it back.

227
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:13,060
I'll find the rabbit demon

228
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,300
and get the soul crystal back.

229
00:15:15,350 --> 00:15:16,300
If it goes into hiding,

230
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:18,540
I'll turn this whole mountain upside down.

231
00:15:19,510 --> 00:15:20,940
If it's swallowed the crystal,

232
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,490
I'll cut its belly open.

233
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:24,970
As long as there's the slightest hope,

234
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:26,970
I won't give up on saving my master.

235
00:15:29,630 --> 00:15:30,300
Xiangyuan,

236
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:32,420
have you ever tried

237
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:33,260
to find him all these years?

238
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:36,380
