239
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,420
have you ever thought of saving him?

240
00:15:38,510 --> 00:15:39,730
Or do you really think

241
00:15:40,870 --> 00:15:42,300
this revenge matters more to you

242
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:44,260
than Cheng Kong?

243
00:15:46,990 --> 00:15:47,900
