244
00:15:48,830 --> 00:15:50,300
to trick me into stopping.

245
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,850
These people made me suffer so much.

246
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:55,420
How could I ever let them go?

247
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:57,690
Wasn't it all because you let others turn you against him?

248
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,690
You keep saying you love Cheng Kong.

249
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:02,850
Then why wouldn't you trust him?

250
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:20,540
I was the one who didn't trust him.

251
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:25,450
I was afraid.

252
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:29,300
He never looked down on me.

253
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:33,090
But the better he treated me,

254
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:37,180
the more I feared I couldn't handle his love.

255
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:41,490
So I grew suspicious

256
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,570
and let others turn me against him.

257
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:48,540
Could it be

258
00:16:50,470 --> 00:16:52,210
that I ruined everything myself?

259
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:18,660
Xiangyuan!

260
00:17:27,120 --> 00:17:27,690
Xiangyuan.

261
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:28,970
Xiangyuan.

262
00:17:30,070 --> 00:17:30,730
It's me.

263
00:17:51,230 --> 00:17:52,420
I've brought Cheng Kong back.

264
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:06,690
Listen,

265
00:18:06,790 --> 00:18:07,690
that gust of wind just now...

266
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:15,530
You said you'd come back

267
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:16,580
when the morning glories bloomed.

268
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:19,250
But no matter how long I waited,

269
00:18:19,270 --> 00:18:20,620
you never came.

270
00:18:24,470 --> 00:18:25,010
Xiangyuan.

271
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:26,250
I'm sorry.

272
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:29,770
I was lucky enough to survive,

273
00:18:31,270 --> 00:18:32,620
but I turned into a demon beast

274
00:18:33,070 --> 00:18:34,620
and could never take human form again.

275
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:38,660
By then, you'd already lost control

276
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:41,140
and created this dream for yourself.

277
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,250
I was afraid that showing up

278
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,250
would shatter the peace you'd found.

279
00:18:46,710 --> 00:18:47,690
I'm sorry, Xiangyuan.

280
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,050
It's all my fault.

281
00:18:56,030 --> 00:18:57,010
Were you afraid

282
00:18:57,470 --> 00:18:59,050
I'd remember everything,

283
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:01,450
suffer even more,

284
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:04,420
and do something I could never undo?

285
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,100
If only I'd spent that time

286
00:19:07,790 --> 00:19:09,140
thinking about finding you

287
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:11,490
instead of seeking revenge,

288
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,970
would things have turned out differently?

289
00:19:24,710 --> 00:19:25,340
Honey.

290
00:19:26,230 --> 00:19:27,900
I can't keep dragging you into this.

291
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:30,450
Everyone in this village

292
00:19:30,470 --> 00:19:32,290
has been transformed by my demonic power.

293
00:19:33,550 --> 00:19:34,770
And I'm the only one

294
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:37,820
who can undo it.

295
00:19:37,840 --> 00:19:39,050
Xiangyuan, what are you doing?

296
00:19:46,840 --> 00:19:47,340
Xiangyuan!

297
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:48,250
Xiangyuan!

298
00:19:49,510 --> 00:19:49,940
Xiangyuan!

299
00:19:52,940 --> 00:19:56,340
♪So many longings...♪

300
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:58,140
Honey.

301
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:01,940
I can't stay with you anymore.

302
00:20:03,790 --> 00:20:04,450
Xiangyuan!

303
00:20:05,270 --> 00:20:06,340
Xiangyuan, no!

304
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:07,010
Xiangyuan!

305
00:20:08,510 --> 00:20:09,940
I failed to protect you.

306
00:20:11,360 --> 00:20:12,690
Xiangyuan, don't leave me!

307
00:20:12,710 --> 00:20:13,420
Xiangyuan!

308
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:14,730
Xiangyuan!

309
00:20:15,790 --> 00:20:17,210
There has to be another way!

310
00:20:18,030 --> 00:20:19,450
Please don't leave me!

311
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:21,770
I failed to protect you.

312
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:22,530
Xiangyuan.

313
00:20:23,270 --> 00:20:24,140
Xiangyuan...

314
00:20:24,790 --> 00:20:25,690
Xiangyuan!

315
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:31,420
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever...♪

316
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,450
Xiangyuan!

317
00:20:34,230 --> 00:20:35,820
Xiangyuan!

318
00:20:36,660 --> 00:20:40,500
♪Still waits to come true♪

319
00:20:41,060 --> 00:20:45,100
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

320
00:20:45,540 --> 00:20:49,140
♪I'll stay by your side♪

321
00:20:49,580 --> 00:20:53,140
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

322
00:20:53,620 --> 00:20:55,980
♪When the dream ends...♪

323
00:20:57,270 --> 00:20:57,970
Xiangyuan.

324
00:21:01,070 --> 00:21:02,900
Consider it repayment for saving my life.

325
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:39,940
Please let us in!

326
00:21:40,710 --> 00:21:41,210
Let us in!

327
00:21:41,230 --> 00:21:42,210
We have something urgent to report!

328
00:21:42,470 --> 00:21:43,530
We need to see Master Du!

329
00:21:43,710 --> 00:21:44,180
That's right!

330
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:45,710
- You two... - Let us in!

331
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:47,180
The master can't see anyone today.

332
00:21:47,550 --> 00:21:48,810
- Why not? - Please leave.

333
00:21:48,810 --> 00:21:50,340
We must see Master Du today!

334
00:21:50,470 --> 00:21:51,210
If we can't see him today,

335
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:52,010
we're not leaving!

336
00:21:52,030 --> 00:21:52,620
What's going on?

337
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:53,970
What's all this noise?

338
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:56,210
Yinhua.

339
00:21:56,510 --> 00:21:57,420
These two immortal sect disciples

340
00:21:57,510 --> 00:21:58,540
just barged into Mount Zhaowu.

341
00:21:58,540 --> 00:21:59,990
They say they have accusations against Hao.

342
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:02,100
Nonsense.

343
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:04,420
I'll handle this.

344
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:05,580
You may leave.

345
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:06,380
Yes.

346
00:22:09,990 --> 00:22:11,970
What brings you two here?

347
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:13,140
We need to see Master Du.

348
00:22:13,790 --> 00:22:14,690
We have something urgent to report.

349
00:22:14,990 --> 00:22:16,690
My master leads the Five Great Sects.

350
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:18,690
You can't just demand to see him.

351
00:22:19,710 --> 00:22:20,820
If you wish to see him,

352
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,250
you must first tell me

353
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,380
what this is about.

354
00:22:23,710 --> 00:22:25,050
Yuwen Hao, Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple,

355
00:22:25,310 --> 00:22:26,450
has been protecting that demon Yamao.

356
00:22:26,550 --> 00:22:27,250
He's betrayed his sect

357
00:22:27,510 --> 00:22:28,100
and turned against the immortal realm...

358
00:22:28,120 --> 00:22:28,600
Shut up!

359
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:32,380
How dare you come to Mount Zhaowu and spread lies

360
00:22:32,840 --> 00:22:33,900
to slander Hao.

361
00:22:34,470 --> 00:22:35,620
You've got some nerve!

362
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:36,660
We swear on our lives

363
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:37,860
that every word is true.

364
00:22:45,990 --> 00:22:47,940
Please, calm down, both of you.

365
00:22:48,270 --> 00:22:50,530
This concerns Mount Zhaowu's reputation.

366
00:22:51,070 --> 00:22:52,140
We have to be careful.

367
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:55,900
Please come with me so we can talk privately.

368
00:22:57,270 --> 00:22:57,770
This way, please.

369
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:13,450
I've caused you all so much trouble.

370
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:14,580
I'm truly sorry.

371
00:23:15,790 --> 00:23:16,860
If you're really sorry,

372
00:23:17,270 --> 00:23:18,490
then give me my master's soul crystal

373
00:23:18,510 --> 00:23:19,420
before you say anything else.

374
00:23:31,070 --> 00:23:32,580
You'd better keep it safe this time.

375
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:33,860
If you lose it again,

376
00:23:33,990 --> 00:23:35,450
I'll make your mystical flower wither.

377
00:23:37,070 --> 00:23:38,530
So the source you mentioned is here?

378
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,890
This water looks so ordinary.

379
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:43,690
How could it have such amazing powers?

380
00:23:45,710 --> 00:23:46,940
This is Peach Blossom Paradise,

381
00:23:47,030 --> 00:23:48,620
created by the Saintess of the Tides a thousand years ago.

382
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:50,180
This river

383
00:23:50,710 --> 00:23:51,940
is actually the entrance to the hidden realm.

384
00:23:54,990 --> 00:23:56,290
Mount Zhaowu has existed for generations.

385
00:23:57,120 --> 00:23:58,420
Why have we never heard of this place?

386
00:23:59,120 --> 00:23:59,900
Peach Blossom Paradise

387
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:01,420
is unlike the mortal world.

388
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:02,950
It's a separate realm

389
00:24:02,950 --> 00:24:03,860
hidden away from the rest of the world.

390
00:24:05,070 --> 00:24:05,690
Miss Yamao,

391
00:24:06,710 --> 00:24:07,660
you've lost too much blood and vital energy.

392
00:24:08,030 --> 00:24:08,860
Your body can't recover on its own.

393
00:24:09,440 --> 00:24:10,340
If the water from that well

394
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:11,730
could ease your condition,

395
00:24:12,470 --> 00:24:13,660
then reaching the true source

396
00:24:14,160 --> 00:24:15,380
should cure you completely.

397
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:17,180
Then how do we open the entrance?

398
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,140
When the first light of dawn appears,

399
00:24:19,750 --> 00:24:20,770
direct the sunlight onto the river.

400
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:22,820
That will open the barrier.

401
00:24:25,550 --> 00:24:26,530
Thank you, Mr. Cheng.

402
00:24:27,030 --> 00:24:28,730
I was just desperate at the time.

403
00:24:28,990 --> 00:24:29,860
That's why I lashed out and hit you.

404
00:24:30,750 --> 00:24:31,820
I'm really sorry.

405
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:33,420
It's all right.

406
00:24:34,840 --> 00:24:36,340
This all happened because of me.

407
00:24:37,030 --> 00:24:38,250
I was so focused on finding the source

408
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:40,420
that I neglected Xiangyuan.

409
00:24:41,360 --> 00:24:42,770
It's too late for regrets now.

410
00:25:04,550 --> 00:25:05,820
Xiangyuan is saying goodbye to you.

411
00:25:07,600 --> 00:25:08,210
She says

412
00:25:08,680 --> 00:25:09,620
you have a kind heart.

413
00:25:11,230 --> 00:25:12,420
She wouldn't say that

414
00:25:13,360 --> 00:25:14,420
if she knew who I really was.

415
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,210
A name is just a name.

416
00:25:38,120 --> 00:25:40,660
This jade pendant can turn you human.

417
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:42,180
What are you doing?

418
00:25:42,710 --> 00:25:44,380
I'm the last surviving member

419
00:25:44,990 --> 00:25:45,940
of my master's lineage.

420
00:25:46,920 --> 00:25:48,010
I've lived alone on the mountain for years.

421
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,290
Xiangyuan sensed

422
00:25:49,310 --> 00:25:49,940
how lonely I was.

423
00:25:50,550 --> 00:25:51,940
That's why she was determined to take human form and keep me company.

424
00:25:52,470 --> 00:25:53,900
Even when she was just a little rabbit,

425
00:25:54,710 --> 00:25:55,660
she was timid and sensitive.

426
00:25:56,600 --> 00:25:57,340
And now,

427
00:25:58,120 --> 00:25:59,490
how could I leave her all alone?

428
00:26:00,790 --> 00:26:01,780
If she can't take human form

429
00:26:01,780 --> 00:26:02,420
to be with me,

430
00:26:04,360 --> 00:26:07,800
then I'll become an animal to stay by her side.

431
00:26:09,960 --> 00:26:10,420
Everyone,

432
00:26:12,160 --> 00:26:12,900
until we meet again.

433
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:30,820
Their love runs so deep

434
00:26:31,790 --> 00:26:33,290
that he'd even give up his humanity for her.

435
00:26:42,840 --> 00:26:43,530
Yamao.

436
00:26:44,990 --> 00:26:47,050
I'd like to speak with you alone.

437
00:26:47,470 --> 00:26:48,420
He wants to take your herb core.

438
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:51,580
No.

439
00:26:52,790 --> 00:26:53,690
That's not what I meant.

440
00:26:54,360 --> 00:26:55,210
If he wanted to kill me,

441
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:56,380
he would've done it long ago.

442
00:26:57,360 --> 00:26:59,140
If you two have something to discuss, take it elsewhere.

443
00:27:07,120 --> 00:27:08,250
I used spiritual power and well water

444
00:27:08,790 --> 00:27:09,580
to make some medicine.

445
00:27:10,750 --> 00:27:11,900
I'm nowhere near as skilled as you,

446
00:27:12,790 --> 00:27:13,790
but if

447
00:27:13,790 --> 00:27:15,310
you can't find the source in time

448
00:27:15,600 --> 00:27:16,660
and your blood and energy run low,

449
00:27:16,990 --> 00:27:17,820
this should help in an emergency.

450
00:27:20,710 --> 00:27:21,900
You're not coming with us?

451
00:27:24,120 --> 00:27:25,010
I came down from the mountain,

452
00:27:25,990 --> 00:27:26,860
but I failed to complete

453
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:27,690
the task my master gave me.

454
00:27:28,510 --> 00:27:29,730
I'll return to Mount Zhaowu to face my punishment.

455
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:31,770
Yamao,

456
00:27:32,790 --> 00:27:34,050
I won't reveal where you're going.

457
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:35,900
I know you have your reasons

458
00:27:36,710 --> 00:27:37,690
for trying to save High Immortal Danshen.

459
00:27:38,470 --> 00:27:39,490
But Qi Fengyin

460
00:27:39,710 --> 00:27:40,820
will eventually become the Devil Incarnate

461
00:27:41,310 --> 00:27:42,010
and bring chaos to the world.

462
00:27:42,120 --> 00:27:43,580
Yet what he did for Xiangyuan

463
00:27:44,600 --> 00:27:45,490
makes me think

464
00:27:46,550 --> 00:27:47,820
the future isn't set in stone.

465
00:27:48,230 --> 00:27:48,940
I know I can't change your mind.

466
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,620
If you insist on traveling with him,

467
00:27:52,200 --> 00:27:53,770
I only hope you'll stay true to yourself

468
00:27:54,360 --> 00:27:55,250
and won't fall under his influence.

469
00:27:57,920 --> 00:27:58,380
Take care.

470
00:27:59,030 --> 00:28:00,490
You stood up for me

471
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:01,490
in front of those two cultivators.

472
00:28:01,710 --> 00:28:02,580
By now, the entire immortal realm

473
00:28:02,600 --> 00:28:03,580
must know

474
00:28:03,790 --> 00:28:04,860
you've betrayed your sect.

475
00:28:05,230 --> 00:28:06,530
You'll definitely be punished if you go back.

476
00:28:06,990 --> 00:28:07,530
Why don't you

477
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:09,100
come with us instead?

478
00:28:12,840 --> 00:28:14,340
You and Qi Fengyin keep each other in check

479
00:28:14,600 --> 00:28:15,380
as you travel together.

480
00:28:16,470 --> 00:28:17,490
But Qi Fengyin and I...

481
00:28:18,790 --> 00:28:20,140
We stand on opposite sides of good and evil.

482
00:28:21,310 --> 00:28:22,210
One day,

483
00:28:23,550 --> 00:28:24,660
I'll kill Qi Fengyin.

484
00:28:26,030 --> 00:28:27,250
That's a problem for another day.

485
00:28:27,270 --> 00:28:28,130
We'll deal with it later.

486
00:28:28,600 --> 00:28:29,260
For now,

487
00:28:29,260 --> 00:28:30,250
just come with us until things calm down.

488
00:28:30,680 --> 00:28:30,940
Come on.

489
00:28:37,880 --> 00:28:39,900
You don't want to come with us.

490
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:41,380
Could it be

491
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:42,180
that you're embarrassed?

492
00:28:43,310 --> 00:28:44,210
Because of

493
00:28:45,030 --> 00:28:45,490
this?

494
00:28:45,510 --> 00:28:45,940
You're...

495
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:47,580
You're reading too much into it.

496
00:28:50,120 --> 00:28:51,050
I know.

497
00:28:51,440 --> 00:28:53,380
For Mount Zhaowu disciples,

498
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:54,140
a spiritual mark means a great deal.

499
00:28:54,440 --> 00:28:55,940
It's not just a sign of cultivation.

500
00:28:56,070 --> 00:28:58,140
It also represents your purity...

501
00:28:58,160 --> 00:28:58,580
Enough.

502
00:28:59,640 --> 00:29:00,420
There's no need to bring up

503
00:29:00,600 --> 00:29:01,580
how you took my spiritual mark.

504
00:29:04,470 --> 00:29:04,970
Actually,

505
00:29:06,200 --> 00:29:07,490
it's not what you think.

506
00:29:14,750 --> 00:29:16,100
The scholars at Mount Zhaowu say

507
00:29:17,270 --> 00:29:19,420
only physical intimacy breaks that vow.

508
00:29:19,600 --> 00:29:20,420
All I did was take

509
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:21,180
Youyou's doll

510
00:29:21,470 --> 00:29:22,970
and rub it against your spiritual mark.

511
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:24,420
Which means

512
00:29:24,840 --> 00:29:25,770
your purity is still intact.

513
00:29:26,470 --> 00:29:27,620
Was it really that easy

514
00:29:28,600 --> 00:29:29,450
to take my spiritual mark?

515
00:29:30,230 --> 00:29:32,120
Then perhaps you should tell me,

516
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:33,910
Hao, what exactly were you dreaming about?

517
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:36,210
Why was your faith so easily shaken?

518
00:29:36,920 --> 00:29:37,490
Ridiculous.

519
00:29:48,750 --> 00:29:50,490
How dare you take Hao's spiritual mark!

520
00:29:50,840 --> 00:29:51,770
You must die!

521
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:52,620
Yinhua!

522
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:54,660
Stop.

523
00:29:56,360 --> 00:29:57,140
What are you thinking?

524
00:29:59,840 --> 00:30:01,380
Master ordered you to take her herb core.

525
00:30:01,550 --> 00:30:03,100
Every sect knows about it.

526
00:30:03,470 --> 00:30:04,180
By doing this,

527
00:30:04,510 --> 00:30:06,050
are you really going to defy Master

528
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:07,180
and betray our sect?

529
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,210
That's my concern.

530
00:30:09,470 --> 00:30:10,820
I'll return to Mount Zhaowu and face my punishment.

531
00:30:13,840 --> 00:30:14,580
I'll just assume

532
00:30:15,840 --> 00:30:17,210
that demon girl has bewitched you.

533
00:30:20,960 --> 00:30:21,580
Yinhua!

534
00:30:27,840 --> 00:30:28,290
Yinhua.

535
00:30:48,670 --> 00:30:49,420
Stop! Both of you!

536
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:50,690
Please, for my sake!

537
00:30:51,960 --> 00:30:53,010
You're nothing but a lowly herb spirit!

538
00:30:53,270 --> 00:30:54,080
Who do you think you are?

539
00:30:54,080 --> 00:30:55,450
I went out of my way to save you,

540
00:30:55,470 --> 00:30:56,250
despite everything you've done.

541
00:30:56,550 --> 00:30:57,540
And you don't even appreciate it.

542
00:30:57,960 --> 00:30:58,860
If you want to die, go ahead!

543
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:00,000
Qi Fengyin, get them!

544
00:31:08,540 --> 00:31:09,100
Go on.

545
00:31:10,840 --> 00:31:11,900
Why should I listen to you?

546
00:31:14,710 --> 00:31:16,450
Didn't you just want to kill them?

547
00:31:16,750 --> 00:31:18,180
That doesn't mean you get to order me around.

548
00:31:20,230 --> 00:31:20,940
We've saved each other's lives

549
00:31:20,990 --> 00:31:21,860
more times than I can count.

550
00:31:21,990 --> 00:31:22,820
They're outsiders.

551
00:31:22,840 --> 00:31:23,940
Can't you just back me up for once?

552
00:31:24,510 --> 00:31:25,970
If I do everything you say,

553
00:31:26,030 --> 00:31:26,970
what happens to my dignity?

554
00:31:28,750 --> 00:31:29,250
Yamao.

555
00:31:30,640 --> 00:31:31,490
Everything I've done on this journey

556
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:33,580
has betrayed my sect.

557
00:31:34,310 --> 00:31:35,180
The next time we meet,

558
00:31:36,270 --> 00:31:37,180
I won't show you any mercy.

559
00:31:37,790 --> 00:31:38,820
You and Qi Fengyin

560
00:31:40,360 --> 00:31:41,340
had better watch yourselves.

561
00:31:44,550 --> 00:31:45,010
Hao.

562
00:31:45,750 --> 00:31:46,420
What about her herb core?

563
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:57,250
I know what I'm doing.

564
00:31:58,030 --> 00:31:59,450
Thank you for sparing my life, Hao.

565
00:32:19,270 --> 00:32:19,940
What are you looking at?

566
00:32:22,310 --> 00:32:24,860
When you faced Xiangyuan alone,

567
00:32:25,550 --> 00:32:26,620
you barely had any magical power left.

568
00:32:27,070 --> 00:32:28,250
How did you manage to restrain her?

569
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:30,100
And it's not like you're

570
00:32:30,100 --> 00:32:31,070
much of a talker.

571
00:32:31,470 --> 00:32:32,310
So how did you manage

572
00:32:32,310 --> 00:32:33,180
to free her from her obsession?

573
00:32:34,990 --> 00:32:36,140
I have my ways.

574
00:32:37,230 --> 00:32:38,940
I don't have to tell you everything.

575
00:32:44,750 --> 00:32:45,730
What exactly are you up to?

576
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:50,290
I've been thinking about the past few days.

577
00:32:50,840 --> 00:32:52,050
You know, Xiangyuan

578
00:32:52,600 --> 00:32:53,590
didn't even know

579
00:32:53,590 --> 00:32:54,530
you were the source of all evil.

580
00:32:55,600 --> 00:32:57,040
She'd never heard

581
00:32:57,230 --> 00:32:58,660
what people say about you.

582
00:33:00,360 --> 00:33:01,140
All she saw

583
00:33:02,250 --> 00:33:03,570
was who you really are.

584
00:33:03,750 --> 00:33:05,180
Even after she became a little rabbit,

585
00:33:05,310 --> 00:33:06,360
she still wanted to be close to you.

586
00:33:06,990 --> 00:33:07,940
That's why I think

587
00:33:09,230 --> 00:33:11,250
you're not the bloodthirsty monster everyone claims.

588
00:33:13,030 --> 00:33:14,190
What's it to you?

589
00:33:22,310 --> 00:33:23,450
We were having a nice conversation.

590
00:33:23,710 --> 00:33:25,200
Why do you suddenly want to water the mystical flower?

591
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:26,620
How about we wait

592
00:33:26,840 --> 00:33:27,970
until we've collected all the malice,

593
00:33:28,310 --> 00:33:29,180
then water the flower

594
00:33:29,400 --> 00:33:29,860
all at once?

595
00:33:30,400 --> 00:33:31,140
No.

596
00:33:31,990 --> 00:33:32,780
This is the only way

597
00:33:33,200 --> 00:33:35,360
to maintain my connection with the mystical flower.

598
00:33:35,840 --> 00:33:37,790
But if we keep doing this,

599
00:33:37,960 --> 00:33:39,010
my body can't take it.

600
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:39,970
How about we wait

601
00:33:40,440 --> 00:33:41,970
until we find the source of the well water,

602
00:33:42,070 --> 00:33:43,380
then water the flower?

603
00:33:51,710 --> 00:33:53,210
You won't die as long as I'm here.

604
00:34:01,680 --> 00:34:02,660
Qi Fengyin!

605
00:34:03,710 --> 00:34:04,770
And here I thought

606
00:34:05,270 --> 00:34:06,490
you could be a good person.

607
00:34:12,880 --> 00:34:13,760
You don't seem

608
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:15,350
to have lost your mind to dark energy.

609
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:16,880
Why would you say something so ridiculous?

610
00:34:18,030 --> 00:34:18,900
I didn't do any of this

611
00:34:18,900 --> 00:34:19,970
for Xiangyuan.

612
00:34:20,550 --> 00:34:21,610
Why would that change how you see me?

613
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:23,190
Right, right.

614
00:34:23,630 --> 00:34:24,610
Everything you do

615
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:25,900
is for the mystical flower.

616
00:34:27,550 --> 00:34:28,530
You care about it so much,

617
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:30,130
yet you claim it's not precious to you.

618
00:34:34,240 --> 00:34:35,010
Fine, I won't bring it up.

619
00:34:35,440 --> 00:34:36,170
Why the long face?

620
00:34:41,990 --> 00:34:42,860
This mystical flower

621
00:34:44,150 --> 00:34:45,570
is a woman's spirit.

622
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:48,970
But I'm not trying to bring her back

623
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:52,170
because I love her.

624
00:34:54,400 --> 00:34:55,300
Then why?

625
00:34:59,110 --> 00:35:00,530
Because I want to kill her myself.

626
00:35:04,720 --> 00:35:06,740
I remember nothing

627
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:08,260
from before I was sealed on Mount Qihuang

628
00:35:09,630 --> 00:35:10,530
a thousand years ago.

629
00:35:11,470 --> 00:35:13,260
But there's one woman I do remember.

630
00:35:16,630 --> 00:35:18,610
She tortured me for a thousand years.

631
00:35:25,670 --> 00:35:27,450
Even the Saintess of the Tides exhausted her divine power

632
00:35:27,960 --> 00:35:29,300
just to seal him away.

633
00:35:30,030 --> 00:35:31,860
This woman must be even more powerful than the Saintess

634
00:35:32,470 --> 00:35:33,820
to have tortured Qi Fengyin.

635
00:35:34,110 --> 00:35:35,530
Through a thousand years of endless torment,

636
00:35:36,630 --> 00:35:37,820
she repeatedly

637
00:35:38,320 --> 00:35:40,050
tore my body apart.

638
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:42,970
Then she healed me completely,

639
00:35:44,720 --> 00:35:46,940
only to torture me all over again.

640
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:48,610
So even though I've forgotten

641
00:35:48,630 --> 00:35:50,010
everything else from those thousand years,

642
00:35:50,280 --> 00:35:51,610
I'll never forget

643
00:35:53,030 --> 00:35:55,130
all the pain she put me through.

644
00:35:57,550 --> 00:35:58,900
Even though she's dead,

645
00:36:00,990 --> 00:36:02,380
I'll nurture this mystical flower

646
00:36:02,400 --> 00:36:03,340
until she takes form again.

647
00:36:04,550 --> 00:36:06,260
Then I'll kill her with my own hands.

648
00:36:06,470 --> 00:36:07,900
You and I have different goals.

649
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:09,530
You're going to save someone.

650
00:36:11,510 --> 00:36:12,820
I'm going to kill someone.

651
00:36:15,190 --> 00:36:16,970
So stop expecting anything good from me.

652
00:36:29,880 --> 00:36:30,900
I wonder if Cheng Kong

653
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:31,700
was telling us the truth.

654
00:36:32,070 --> 00:36:33,610
He's never even been to Peach Blossom Paradise.

655
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:34,650
It's almost dawn.

656
00:37:05,510 --> 00:37:06,420
Qi... Qi Fengyin!

657
00:37:06,510 --> 00:37:07,220
I can see it.

658
00:37:08,760 --> 00:37:09,220
Let's go.

659
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:15,040
Youyou! Youyou!

660
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:16,740
What is it? What's wrong?

661
00:37:21,580 --> 00:37:23,860
[Mount Zhaowu]

662
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:28,300
Master treats you like his own son.

663
00:37:28,720 --> 00:37:29,810
Are you really going to

664
00:37:29,810 --> 00:37:30,740
defy his orders

665
00:37:31,190 --> 00:37:32,180
for a mere herb spirit?

666
00:37:34,440 --> 00:37:35,820
My answer hasn't changed

667
00:37:36,150 --> 00:37:36,970
since the last time we spoke.

668
00:37:37,840 --> 00:37:38,740
Is it because she

669
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:39,700
took your spiritual mark

670
00:37:39,990 --> 00:37:41,170
that you're so determined to protect her?

671
00:37:46,470 --> 00:37:48,090
You eavesdropped on our conversation?

672
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:50,820
Why won't you talk about it?

673
00:37:50,990 --> 00:37:51,940
For a Mount Zhaowu disciple,

674
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:53,780
losing a spiritual mark is like losing one's purity.

675
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:54,420
Hao...

676
00:37:54,440 --> 00:37:54,860
Yinhua.

677
00:37:58,360 --> 00:37:59,490
I spoke out of turn

678
00:37:59,920 --> 00:38:00,860
because I lost my temper.

679
00:38:02,440 --> 00:38:03,260
I was wrong.

680
00:38:04,590 --> 00:38:05,340
What happened with my spiritual mark

681
00:38:06,070 --> 00:38:07,530
was just an unfortunate misunderstanding.

682
00:38:07,920 --> 00:38:08,900
There's nothing

683
00:38:09,320 --> 00:38:10,340
between Yamao and me.

684
00:38:10,720 --> 00:38:11,650
My decision to defy Master

685
00:38:12,400 --> 00:38:13,170
has nothing to do with her.

686
00:38:14,320 --> 00:38:15,050
Even if it had been

687
00:38:15,070 --> 00:38:15,900
someone other than Yamao,

688
00:38:16,800 --> 00:38:17,700
I would've done the same.

689
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:18,340
Hao...

690
00:38:18,550 --> 00:38:19,260
Besides,

691
00:38:21,070 --> 00:38:22,090
before returning to the mountain,

692
00:38:22,630 --> 00:38:24,260
I rescued Yamao

693
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:25,260
from two immortal sect disciples.

694
00:38:25,720 --> 00:38:26,860
Word that I've betrayed the immortal sects

695
00:38:27,280 --> 00:38:28,900
has probably spread throughout every sect by now.

696
00:38:29,720 --> 00:38:30,340
That can't be.

697
00:38:30,670 --> 00:38:31,260
Hao.

698
00:38:31,360 --> 00:38:31,900
Yinhua.

699
00:38:33,070 --> 00:38:33,610
Hao.

700
00:38:34,110 --> 00:38:35,170
Master sent me to welcome you back.

701
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,490
Did your journey go well?

702
00:38:40,630 --> 00:38:41,730
Why didn't you bring

703
00:38:41,730 --> 00:38:42,450
Yamao back?

704
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:44,100
Couldn't you find her?

705
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:46,090
Before we returned,

706
00:38:46,630 --> 00:38:47,450
did any immortal sect disciples

707
00:38:47,470 --> 00:38:48,300
come to see Master?

708
00:38:49,440 --> 00:38:49,970
No, none.

709
00:38:50,670 --> 00:38:51,600
If anyone had come to visit,

710
00:38:52,080 --> 00:38:53,000
they would've had to go through me.

711
00:38:54,070 --> 00:38:55,330
Could those disciples

712
00:38:56,110 --> 00:38:57,530
have kept this from Master?

713
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:01,530
You found her,

714
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:04,190
but you let her go?

715
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:05,090
Master,

716
00:39:06,470 --> 00:39:07,300
I know I was wrong.

717
00:39:08,110 --> 00:39:08,970
Master, please hear me out.

718
00:39:09,150 --> 00:39:10,780
This is all Yamao's fault.

719
00:39:10,990 --> 00:39:12,340
That demon girl has betrayed the immortal realm

720
00:39:12,440 --> 00:39:13,860
and is under the protection of Qi Fengyin, that devil.

721
00:39:13,990 --> 00:39:15,780
That's why Hao couldn't carry out your orders.

722
00:39:16,190 --> 00:39:16,700
Hao.

723
00:39:18,590 --> 00:39:19,050
Is that true?

724
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:20,700
Even without Qi Fengyin's protection,

725
00:39:21,150 --> 00:39:21,650
I still

726
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:24,170
wouldn't take Yamao's herb core.

727
00:39:32,720 --> 00:39:33,970
Ever since you joined Mount Zhaowu,

728
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,570
you've never disobeyed me.

729
00:39:37,760 --> 00:39:38,740
Why now?

730
00:39:40,630 --> 00:39:41,420
I'd like to ask you something, too.

731
00:39:42,920 --> 00:39:43,970
Why must we kill her

732
00:39:44,670 --> 00:39:45,900
to save the world?

733
00:39:47,800 --> 00:39:48,420
She only took human form

734
00:39:48,670 --> 00:39:50,130
because she received a wisp

735
00:39:50,150 --> 00:39:50,940
of the Saintess's divine power.

736
00:39:51,960 --> 00:39:52,940
Now we're simply

737
00:39:53,190 --> 00:39:55,090
returning that power to its rightful owner.

738
00:39:55,440 --> 00:39:56,900
Yamao became a spirit through that divine power.

739
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:59,260
That was her own good fortune.

740
00:39:59,630 --> 00:40:00,610
She owes no one anything.

741
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:02,130
And she's done nothing wrong.

742
00:40:02,510 --> 00:40:04,010
Why should she give up her core?

743
00:40:04,670 --> 00:40:05,610
Even if that power must be returned,

744
00:40:06,190 --> 00:40:07,780
the Saintess herself should ask for it.

745
00:40:07,920 --> 00:40:08,420
Hao.

746
00:40:11,510 --> 00:40:12,170
I'm giving you

747
00:40:12,670 --> 00:40:14,170
one last chance.

748
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:17,650
Where did Yamao and Qi Fengyin go?

749
00:40:33,660 --> 00:40:34,410
Fine.

750
00:40:36,480 --> 00:40:37,500
So this is the disciple

751
00:40:37,500 --> 00:40:38,970
I, Du Zhong, raised myself!

752
00:40:39,400 --> 00:40:40,340
I've clearly

753
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,570
praised your talent too much over the years.

754
00:40:42,110 --> 00:40:43,610
Now you think you're above everyone else.

755
00:40:44,670 --> 00:40:45,490
In that case,

756
00:40:46,280 --> 00:40:48,260
you'll go to the lowest level of Wuchang Prison

757
00:40:49,510 --> 00:40:50,860
and spend some time there

758
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:51,610
strengthening your resolve.

759
00:40:53,110 --> 00:40:53,740
Master!

760
00:40:54,150 --> 00:40:55,260
The lowest level of Wuchang Prison

761
00:40:55,360 --> 00:40:56,130
is reserved

762
00:40:56,150 --> 00:40:57,380
for our sect's worst offenders.

763
00:40:57,630 --> 00:40:58,300
But Hao

764
00:40:58,440 --> 00:40:59,260
has done nothing to deserve that.

765
00:40:59,400 --> 00:41:01,380
And that place is bitterly cold,

766
00:41:01,630 --> 00:41:02,380
with such intense dark energy

767
00:41:02,400 --> 00:41:03,340
that it could destroy his cultivation foundation.

768
00:41:03,550 --> 00:41:05,010
Master, please reconsider.

769
00:41:06,920 --> 00:41:08,740
Once he's come to his senses

770
00:41:09,760 --> 00:41:11,170
and tells me where Yamao is,

771
00:41:11,550 --> 00:41:12,420
only then

772
00:41:12,960 --> 00:41:14,340
will he leave Wuchang Prison.

773
00:41:15,150 --> 00:41:15,690
I

774
00:41:17,510 --> 00:41:18,300
accept my punishment.

775
00:41:20,340 --> 00:41:24,100
[Wuchang Prison]

776
00:41:27,400 --> 00:41:27,940
Hao.

777
00:41:29,550 --> 00:41:30,820
Even if you refuse to kill Yamao,

778
00:41:31,840 --> 00:41:32,650
countless others want her dead

779
00:41:32,670 --> 00:41:34,210
so they can take her herb core.

780
00:41:34,710 --> 00:41:36,130
Why defy Master over this?

781
00:41:37,190 --> 00:41:37,980
I've made up my mind.

782
00:41:46,920 --> 00:41:47,940
The cold here cuts right to the bone.

783
00:41:48,710 --> 00:41:49,420
If this continues,

784
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,090
your cultivation foundation

785
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:52,340
will be badly damaged.

786
00:41:52,630 --> 00:41:53,690
Is it really worth it?

787
00:42:18,860 --> 00:42:22,380
[Peach Blossom Paradise]

788
00:42:31,400 --> 00:42:32,820
This place is full of foul energy.

789
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:33,940
What a disappointment.

790
00:42:34,280 --> 00:42:36,260
And they call this a paradise?

791
00:42:36,670 --> 00:42:37,570
Cheng Kong is such a liar.

792
00:42:37,960 --> 00:42:39,420
But Cheng Kong had no reason to lie to us.

793
00:42:40,280 --> 00:42:42,010
Could it be that the Saintess hasn't awakened,

794
00:42:42,590 --> 00:42:43,860
and this entire realm

795
00:42:43,880 --> 00:42:44,690
is dying along with her?

796
00:42:46,510 --> 00:42:47,300
Where's Qi Fengyin?

797
00:42:47,760 --> 00:42:49,010
Did we get separated?

798
00:42:49,230 --> 00:42:50,090
Yamao.

799
00:42:51,190 --> 00:42:52,530
I'm so dizzy.

800
00:42:54,880 --> 00:42:55,610
This foul energy

801
00:42:55,960 --> 00:42:56,980
is draining our spiritual power.

802
00:42:57,800 --> 00:42:58,530
Let's get out of here.

803
00:43:14,230 --> 00:43:14,690
Follow me.

804
00:43:23,710 --> 00:43:24,780
How did you get in here?

805
00:43:25,230 --> 00:43:26,460
Outsiders can't enter this place.

806
00:43:26,840 --> 00:43:27,490
If it weren't for me,

807
00:43:27,800 --> 00:43:29,130
you'd be nothing but bones by now.

808
00:43:30,190 --> 00:43:30,980
Outsiders?

809
00:43:32,360 --> 00:43:33,380
You live here in the Peach Blossom Paradise?

810
00:43:34,670 --> 00:43:35,530
Just call me Yuanbao.

811
00:43:36,110 --> 00:43:36,610
Miss,

812
00:43:36,960 --> 00:43:38,090
do you know

813
00:43:38,130 --> 00:43:39,490
what happened to this place?

814
00:43:39,960 --> 00:43:40,980
And that dragon's roar earlier...

815
00:43:41,280 --> 00:43:42,090
What was that?

816
00:43:42,190 --> 00:43:42,940
This foul energy

817
00:43:43,230 --> 00:43:44,570
is the breath of an ancient black dragon.

818
00:43:45,030 --> 00:43:45,900
I'm out of arrows.

819
00:43:46,150 --> 00:43:46,860
Don't draw it over here.

820
00:43:47,280 --> 00:43:47,980
A black dragon?

821
00:43:48,400 --> 00:43:49,570
The one we encountered before?

822
00:43:51,480 --> 00:43:52,010
That's right.

823
00:43:52,960 --> 00:43:53,690
This paradise

824
00:43:53,840 --> 00:43:55,090
was once a sacred sanctuary

825
00:43:55,110 --> 00:43:55,900
created by the Saintess.

826
00:43:56,440 --> 00:43:57,530
But that vile black dragon

827
00:43:57,550 --> 00:43:58,530
snuck in when it was vulnerable,

828
00:43:58,760 --> 00:43:59,820
devouring its inhabitants

829
00:44:00,480 --> 00:44:01,570
and spreading this foul energy.

830
00:44:02,110 --> 00:44:03,050
Qi Fengyin is missing.

831
00:44:03,710 --> 00:44:04,820
What if this foul energy

832
00:44:04,840 --> 00:44:05,460
swallowed him up?

833
00:44:05,960 --> 00:44:06,860
What do we do?

834
00:44:07,590 --> 00:44:08,420
What are you doing?

835
00:44:09,070 --> 00:44:09,530
My Lord!

836
00:44:10,000 --> 00:44:11,340
Where did you go?

837
00:44:13,920 --> 00:44:15,210
I couldn't find either of you.

838
00:44:15,510 --> 00:44:17,050
I was searching for you while looking for the source.

839
00:44:19,000 --> 00:44:20,420
This paradise is filled with foul energy.

840
00:44:20,960 --> 00:44:22,490
How can you still wander around looking for people?

841
00:44:23,070 --> 00:44:24,210
And you don't have a scratch on you.

842
00:44:31,710 --> 00:44:32,780
The foul energy here is too strong.

843
00:44:33,070 --> 00:44:34,210
The source is probably ruined, too.

844
00:44:34,480 --> 00:44:34,940
Let's go back.

845
00:44:35,550 --> 00:44:36,050
But...

846
00:44:37,280 --> 00:44:38,940
The water from that well helped me.

847
00:44:39,440 --> 00:44:41,210
That means the source is still clean.

848
00:44:41,880 --> 00:44:42,860
Let's keep looking.

849
00:44:47,110 --> 00:44:47,610
Yamao.

850
00:44:49,190 --> 00:44:50,460
The mystical spring you're looking for...

851
00:44:51,070 --> 00:44:52,170
I think I know where it is.

852
00:44:53,000 --> 00:44:53,610
Take us there.

853
00:45:08,760 --> 00:45:09,820
But that vile black dragon

854
00:45:09,920 --> 00:45:11,340
wants to use our souls in a blood sacrifice.

855
00:45:11,480 --> 00:45:12,420
Please save us

856
00:45:12,590 --> 00:45:13,610
and slay the black dragon!

857
00:45:14,400 --> 00:45:15,010
My Lord!

858
00:45:15,230 --> 00:45:15,980
Qi Fengyin!

859
00:45:16,960 --> 00:45:17,650
Qi Fengyin!

860
